 <tr>
  <td>
   <font face="verdana,arial" size="2" color="#000000"><strong><a HREF="https://ftp.cpc.ncep.noaa.gov/wd52dg/data/indices/nao_index.tim">Historical Index:</a></strong> Monthly tabulated NAO index dating back to 1950. Indices are standardized by the 1981-2010 climatology.</font><br><br>
